.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable debug output
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Enable verbose output
.TP
\fB\-\-mangohud\fR
Enable MangoHud: FPS, frame timing and performance overlay
.TP
\fB\-\-gamemode\fR
Enable GameMode: Optimize system performance for gaming
.TP
\fB\-\-gamescope\fR
Enable Gamescope: allows setting an internal resolution, refresh rate and various display options
.TP
\fB\-\-call\fR
Use Proton\-Call
.TP
\fB\-\-wine\fR
Use Wine
.TP
\fB\-\-proton\fR
Use Proton only (default)
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
